  "reviewed_at": "2026-10-05",
  "notes": "The host moved from api.together.xyz to api.together.ai. GET /v1/models answers a bare array, so models are declared. service_tier, store, metadata and prediction are accepted but ignored, and logit_bias is unsupported on most models; all are refused. Only max_tokens is documented. Rerank, documented at https://docs.together.ai/reference/rerank-1, serves dedicated endpoints and refuses truncation, which it has no control for.",
